# HARD.P0-8 — H8: fix the four vacuous gate scripts

## Fixes applied (scripts/gates/)

- m02.sh: the M2.gate TODO check called h_pass in BOTH branches, so it could
  never fail. The else branch now calls h_fail.
- m11.sh: the unknown-command exit code was captured after `|| true`, so it
  was always 0 and never asserted. The exit code is now captured in an `if`
  guard (set -e safe) and asserted to equal 2.
- m16a.sh: the CORS check passed when the Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
  was ABSENT (an empty string fails the grep -qF '*' test, so the pass branch
  fired). The gate now fails when the header is absent and passes only when
  the header is present and not a wildcard.
- m19.sh: the M19.gate task recorded an unconditional h_pass. It now rolls up
  the task statuses recorded by this run (m24 pattern) and fails when any
  T19.x task failed.

